# Probe CSV captures from the sim harness (24-AUG-2026). These are REGENERATED
# by a sim run - they are test output, not source - and they get big: the two
# GitHub flagged over its 50 MB advisory were lbyt_st.csv at 99 MB and
# word2e_w2e.csv at 61 MB. Durable captures belong in $ND120_ORACLE_DIR.
Verilog/sim/lbyt_*.csv
Verilog/sim/word2*_*.csv

