# Copy of the font that build.tcl drops next to font_rom.v, because Vivado
# resolves $readmemh relative to the .v source rather than the project. The
# master is Verilog/Terminals/font/font8x16.hex; this one is regenerated by
# every console build and must not be tracked, or the two can silently differ.
Verilog/Terminals/rtl/font8x16.hex

